Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.69,0:00:04.89,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's July, and our term finals\Nare in the rear view.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.89,0:00:07.73,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I hope you're all doing well\Nback in Ikajima.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:09.67,Default,NARUSE,0,0,0,,Finally done!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.47,0:00:14.86,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Just for today, I'll stop\Nworrying about my grades
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:16.87,DefaultTop,KOSHINO,0,0,0,,A movie means we could all go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:18.21,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,and the other stuff bothering me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:19.35,DefaultTop,YAMADA,0,0,0,,What? Karaoke sounds like a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.55,0:00:27.29,Flashback,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I think this is the first time\NI've ever been real friends with a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:31.74,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm feeling like forgetting all about them!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.06,0:00:33.80,DefaultTop,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.06,0:00:36.01,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But it's not all fun and games.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:36.01,DefaultTop,MINE,0,0,0,,Yeah, bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:40.01,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,There's a student council\Nroundtable after school today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.61,0:00:45.39,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I apologize for not letting you know\Nsooner, but I, Iwakura Mitsumi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:49.57,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,have officially been appointed student\Ncouncil secretary for the first term!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.02,0:02:38.01,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I'd like to end the roundtable on that note.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:40.78,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,As for the new student\Ncouncil president, naturally,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:43.16,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Takamine-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:47.22,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Thanks to you all, we've had\Nanother productive discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.73,0:02:52.02,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Now, the closing address\Nif you would, please, President.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:54.60,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,...was the clear favorite in my mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.77,0:03:00.28,Default,HIROTO,0,0,0,,Thank you all for joining us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.73,0:03:05.14,Default,HIROTO,0,0,0,,The all-new student council\Nis raring to get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.14,0:03:10.45,Default,HIROTO,0,0,0,,And we'd like to take your ideas into\Naccount and make our school even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:16.62,Default,HIROTO,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're all worn out from the exams,\Nso I think I'll cut my speech short there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.58,0:03:19.16,Default,HIROTO,0,0,0,,Great work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:21.01,Default,HIROTO,0,0,0,,Go home and get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.03,0:03:26.52,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Mitsumi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:31.23,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Congrats on officially\Njoining the student council!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.23,0:03:34.36,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Kanechika-senpai! Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:35.61,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,I'll grab this end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:39.60,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I didn't know you took part in roundtables.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:43.61,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, I've never missed\None that didn't overlap with club.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.61,0:03:47.16,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,After all, great ideas are born \Nfrom such communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:50.41,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, Takamine-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:53.51,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,It's a shame how the presidential \Nelection turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.51,0:03:56.16,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,But being vice president\Nis nothing to sneeze at.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.16,0:03:57.04,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:04:02.42,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,If anything, the vice president\Nmay shoulder more responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.91,0:04:06.68,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,In any field, the right-hand man \Nis a crucial position.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.68,0:04:08.85,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm rooting for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:10.48,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Vice President!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.31,0:04:15.77,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Mi... Mitsumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:17.51,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I leave the rest to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:23.80,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Mitsumi-kun... Was I perhaps\Nbeing really insensitive just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:32.46,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Kanechika-senpai, Takamine-senpai's\Nwounds are still very fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.81,0:04:40.97,Flashback,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tsubame Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:44.58,Flashback,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,The upcoming general assembly will mark\Nthe end of us third-years' term in office.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:46.58,Flashback,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,We'll do our best with this material.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:47.93,Flashback,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:49.38,Flashback,ALL,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.38,0:04:50.56,Flashback,ALL,0,0,0,,A job well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:51.93,Flashback,ALL,0,0,0,,Thank you for your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:56.82,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,We'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:59.52,Flashback,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,I can rest easy knowing my\Nsuccessor will do a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:01.34,Flashback,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Counting on you, Takamine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:02.82,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:06.64,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yesterday was the deadline for\Nthe presidential candidacies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:10.56,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,It sounds like I was the only one,\Nso it'll go to a vote of confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.56,0:05:12.33,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,It's too bad. I was hoping to compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:15.86,Flashback,SC A,0,0,0,,Oh, someone else entered\Njust before the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.86,0:05:16.54,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.07,0:05:20.96,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, really? But given my track\Nrecord, I should be able to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:22.30,Flashback,SC A,0,0,0,,It's Kazakami-kun, the second-year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.66,0:05:25.31,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Huh... I wonder what he's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:30.05,Flashback,MIKA,0,0,0,,Kazakami-senpai from second-year, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:31.93,Flashback,MIKA,0,0,0,,A formidable foe appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.93,0:05:34.91,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Damn, Mika-chan, you know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:36.71,Flashback,MIKA,0,0,0,,Well, duh, he's famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:39.02,Flashback,MIKA,0,0,0,,Like, Shima-kun famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:40.19,Flashback,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:43.14,Flashback,MIKA,0,0,0,,He was in line to be\Nthe soccer team's captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:45.23,Flashback,MIKA,0,0,0,,but he quit after an injury this spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.23,0:05:47.65,Flashback,MIKA,0,0,0,,Maybe he wanted to try something new?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:49.07,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.07,0:05:52.10,Flashback,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,He must be a good leader\Nif he was in line to be captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:54.74,Flashback,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,which means the guys will vote for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:56.59,Flashback,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,So will the girls. In droves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.59,0:06:00.58,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But Takamine-senpai has been\Non the council since her first year!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:04.97,Flashback,MIKA,0,0,0,,I mean, we know she's dedicated\Nbecause you've told us,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:07.88,Flashback,MIKA,0,0,0,,but it can be hard to tell from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:12.26,Flashback,MIKA,0,0,0,,Honestly, Takamine-senpai seems\Ntoo serious and kinda scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:15.58,Flashback,MIKA,0,0,0,,She'll have a tough time\Nagainst one of the populars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.64,0:06:20.77,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,No! No one is more invested\Nin the school's affairs than she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.77,0:06:23.88,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,And a leader has to be tough at times!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.88,0:06:26.75,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm sure a lot of people get that!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.75,0:06:27.90,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Don'cha reckon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.07,0:06:30.20,FlashbackItalics,ALL,0,0,0,,Reckon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:36.04,Flashback,TEACH,0,0,0,,You are hereby elected\Nthe new student council president.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.87,0:06:43.25,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:48.42,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Well, what's done is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.85,0:06:52.51,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Kazakami-san was forced to give up soccer, \Nsomething he'd devoted himself to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.11,0:06:56.62,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll direct his energies\Nto his presidential duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.75,0:06:58.93,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.93,0:07:03.68,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of giving him this\N"things to do as president" notebook!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:07.98,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I've been keeping notes in it \Nsince I was a first-year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.98,0:07:09.70,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:13.00,Flashback,BOYS,0,0,0,,My brother had the same injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.87,Flashback,BOYS,0,0,0,,If you've recovered that much, \Nyou could've made it back by next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.24,0:07:17.95,Flashback,HIROTO,0,0,0,,Honestly, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.95,0:07:21.50,Flashback,HIROTO,0,0,0,,But I never intended to be\Nin a club as a third-year anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.50,0:07:23.24,Flashback,BOYS,0,0,0,,What? Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:26.78,Flashback,HIROTO,0,0,0,,Student council terms are up\Nwithin the year, which is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.78,0:07:29.54,Flashback,HIROTO,0,0,0,,And it puts me on the teachers' \Nradar in a good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.54,0:07:31.63,Flashback,BOYS,0,0,0,,You sure do love to stand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:35.89,Flashback,HIROTO,0,0,0,,Hey, I was born to lead, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:39.63,Flashback,BOYS,0,0,0,,You suck ass! Begone, himbo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:40.69,FlashbackItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,He nailed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.69,0:07:43.27,FlashbackItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,He nailed the joke\NI failed spectacularly with!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:46.69,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:48.34,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I'm a fool, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:49.32,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:54.57,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,But this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.17,0:07:58.30,Flashback,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,is all I can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:09.71,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I wanted to cheer her up, but I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.13,0:08:13.52,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But I've begun to realize\Nthe same thing she has.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.23,0:08:19.22,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Hard work builds confidence, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:25.96,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's scary that all we can do \Nis hope that it'll pay off someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:33.38,Default,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:34.61,Default,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.61,0:08:36.47,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You guys have day duties?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:40.87,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's Takamine-senpai\Nand me on Tuesdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.87,0:08:42.93,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Wow. Must be rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:44.17,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.17,0:08:47.74,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,There's never much to do,\Nso I use the time to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:49.98,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Oh, mind if I come?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.98,0:08:50.59,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.59,0:08:52.22,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You study, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.22,0:08:54.55,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I've got time to kill today, so is it okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.96,0:08:56.86,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's... probably fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:08:58.22,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:09:00.03,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's gone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:04.74,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I think my friendship level's \Ngone up in his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:12.95,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:14.86,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Huh? Shima-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:18.71,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Excellent. I wanted you to see this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.71,0:09:19.37,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:33.35,DefaultItalics,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Dun... dun... duuun....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.18,0:09:36.24,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Charley?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:38.45,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Charley horse? As in a leg cramp?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:41.83,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,I thought it was a clever name at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:42.43,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.41,0:09:46.06,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:48.20,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.81,0:09:50.78,DefaultItalics,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Yes, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:53.08,DefaultItalics,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Based on the elevation\Nof the mountain behind it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:55.55,DefaultItalics,NARUMI,0,0,0,,I estimate its head to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:09:59.39,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,It's my debut film from when\NI wanted to be a movie director!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.44,0:10:02.06,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,I was in fifth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:05.33,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,And because I had no friends,\NI was a one-man cast and crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:10.76,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,This is the second time you've\Nasked me to watch something...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:11.59,DefaultItalicsTop,NARUMI,0,0,0,,This is extremely bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:15.24,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I appreciate actual child actors more now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:18.09,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,I think I know what you're trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:22.35,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,I was super into tokusatsu at the time, \Nso I ripped off the setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:26.35,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,The story's about a child prodigy, me, \Ncontacting a famous paleontologist
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:29.52,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,when he sees the kaiju Charley Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:32.34,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Doesn't saying it out loud embarrass him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.05,0:10:38.28,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Wait, are you actually really embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:41.99,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Of course I am! I'm sweating buckets here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:44.08,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Then why show it to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:46.12,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Because, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.49,0:10:48.51,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Isn't this hilarious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.51,0:10:52.67,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,I know you guys are trying to be polite, \Nbut it's okay to laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:58.28,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Of course, I want to create something\Namazing someday and gain widespread acclaim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:11:02.60,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,But between never showing this awful thing\Nto anyone and making you three laugh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:04.30,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,I chose the latter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:10.96,DefaultItalics,NARUMI,0,0,0,,But it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.96,0:11:12.39,DefaultItalics,NARUMI,0,0,0,,With Hyper Charley...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.39,0:11:17.45,DefaultItalics,NARUMI,0,0,0,,With the super missile I developed\Novernight, Hyper Charley EX,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:19.49,DefaultItalics,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Charley Horse will be reduced to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:21.70,DefaultItalics,NARUMIDAD,0,0,0,,Naru-kun! Naru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.21,0:11:24.75,DefaultItalics,NARUMIDAD,0,0,0,,Want some watermelon? Naru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:25.70,DefaultItalics,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Shh! Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:27.25,DefaultItalics,NARUMIDAD,0,0,0,,Grandma brought... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:29.20,DefaultItalics,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Dad, I'm filming right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.45,0:11:31.11,DefaultItalics,NARUMIDAD,0,0,0,,Oh, am I on camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.57,0:11:32.80,DefaultItalics,NARUMIDAD,0,0,0,,Yay! Peace, peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.20,DefaultItalics,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:38.43,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Okay, show's over! Everyone go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:44.09,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Mitsumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.73,0:11:46.60,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Takamine-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.91,0:11:49.38,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,The other day was fun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:50.75,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.59,0:11:53.60,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I laugh every time I think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.19,0:11:59.86,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,You see, it helped me finally\Ncome to terms with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:01.41,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:05.03,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,What I'm lacking right now is\Nmagnanimity and playfulness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:10.92,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,So I tried making a list of everything from\Ndaily relaxations to monthly indulgences.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:13.75,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Whoa! I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:29.51,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That's wonderful! It's very you, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.79,0:12:32.02,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.70,0:12:34.77,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Kazakami-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.18,0:12:36.30,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Just who I wanted to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:37.20,Default,HIROTO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.77,0:12:41.03,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I should have said this sooner.\NI look forward to working with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.58,0:12:44.78,Default,HIROTO,0,0,0,,Oh, likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.25,0:12:48.34,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I hope to learn a lot from you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:52.06,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Do you want to go eat something\Nsweet sometime this week?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:55.41,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, my schedule's packed for this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.41,0:12:56.66,DefaultItalics,HIROTO,0,0,0,,What was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:13:01.13,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It couldn't hurt to \Nslack off once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.13,0:13:02.03,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Slack off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.92,0:13:04.62,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.62,0:13:08.21,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,If my exam grades are good\Nenough, I'll consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:09.25,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Urk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.25,0:13:10.85,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I forgot all about those!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.68,0:13:19.99,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Summer break's almost here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.99,0:13:20.99,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.99,0:13:23.29,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I can't wait to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.29,0:13:26.12,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Yeah, you didn't go back over Golden Week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:29.46,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'll go to the beach every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.46,0:13:32.70,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Stuff myself with tomatoes and watermelons!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:36.50,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,And maybe get my folks to\Nbuy me a huge fireworks set!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:39.25,DefaultItalics,NAO,0,0,0,,Sounds like a kid's schedule...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.25,0:13:42.39,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I hope I can bring my school\Nfriends to visit someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.39,0:13:44.13,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Shima-kun says he likes the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:47.63,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Mitsu...? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.63,0:13:51.57,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,You talk about this Shima-kun an awful lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.57,0:13:55.39,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,D-Do I? He's a friend named \NShima Sousuke-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.91,0:13:57.56,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,See you, Nao-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:13:59.42,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:03.22,DefaultItalics,NAO,0,0,0,,Shima... Sousuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.22,0:14:05.34,DefaultItalics,NAO,0,0,0,,Just what kind of character is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.65,0:14:08.15,DefaultItalics,NAO,0,0,0,,Shimasuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.38,0:14:14.66,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Shima-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.53,0:14:22.28,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:25.82,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Morning, Mitsumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:26.99,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.99,0:14:28.80,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Were you apologizing for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.80,0:14:31.54,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Oh, she asked for my contact details.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:34.68,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,And, well... You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:36.44,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,So you said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:38.44,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I've been trying to recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:42.74,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I don't think she was asking\Nbecause she wanted to be friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:44.44,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,so I couldn't half-ass it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.79,0:14:47.86,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, the regality of a popular person!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.01,0:14:51.70,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Mitsumi-chan, are you gonna\Ngo home over summer break?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:54.20,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah. I gotta bring gifts\Nfor everyone back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.52,0:14:56.33,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Like Fumi-chan, who gave you \Nthe panda hairpins?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:58.71,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah! Good memory!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:01.85,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I told her I'd go see Liang Liang and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.85,0:15:03.48,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,So I gotta go to the zoo
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:08.36,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,and pick up a coin pouch, a handkerchief,\Nor other panda merch to pay her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:10.09,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Oh, sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:13.99,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Huh? But I think the zoo's gonna be \Nsuper crowded over summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.13,0:15:17.97,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I hadn't looked into that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.42,0:15:20.16,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Morning, Shima-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:21.48,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:23.01,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,He's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.01,0:15:24.00,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:25.48,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Nope. No idea who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:35.17,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Boys, it is {\i1}so{\i0} happening right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:37.93,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,The pre-summer-break popularity rush is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.62,0:15:41.04,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,That's Yagi-senpai, the Madonna \Nof the second-years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:44.13,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,How I want to be you, Shima!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:45.42,Default,NISHINO,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:47.45,Default,NISHINO,0,0,0,,What do you mean by rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:52.11,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,It's elementary. Once summer break starts, \Nyou won't see your crush for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.11,0:15:57.39,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,So a lot of people start asking for \Ncontact info or straight up ask them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:16:03.26,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Why, I couldn't muster up the courage\Nto ask Kaori-chan, my middle school love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:07.51,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,And then I found out she'd gotten\Na boyfriend over summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.51,0:16:09.03,Default,NARUSENISHINO,0,0,0,,S-Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:12.18,Default,NISHINO,0,0,0,,Even Shima couldn't say no \Nto a girl like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:14.83,Default,NARUSE,0,0,0,,That, or he's already got a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.83,0:16:16.28,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm not listening! I hear nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:19.03,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,If you ask someone you\Nbarely know for their details,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.03,0:16:22.09,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,that's a 100 percent guarantee\Nyou can't be just friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:25.12,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,It takes real guts and courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.12,0:16:28.49,FlashbackItalics,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I don't think she was asking\Nbecause she wanted to be friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.16,0:16:30.55,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.55,0:16:32.99,Default,NISHINO,0,0,0,,They're doing their best\Nto put it out there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:35.18,Default,NARUSE,0,0,0,,That'd make any guy super happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.54,0:16:38.62,DefaultItalics,KENTONISHINONARUSE,0,0,0,,Hear that, girls? It'd make \Nany guy super happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:41.56,DefaultItalics,JOUGASAKINAGATA,0,0,0,,At least try to cover up \Nthat you don't care who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.87,0:16:42.79,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,He's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:44.53,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Hey there, hot stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:46.56,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Yagi-senpai wanted to talk to you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:48.39,Default,NARUSE,0,0,0,,What'd she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.39,0:16:50.77,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Oh, you know, just stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.77,0:16:53.07,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Sorry, don't tell anyone what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.07,0:16:54.39,Default,KENTA,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.39,0:16:55.72,DefaultItalics,MOTOBAYASHI,0,0,0,,So he shot her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:57.07,DefaultItalics,YAMAMORI,0,0,0,,How slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:17:00.41,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm relieved, but my heart pains for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.41,0:17:06.35,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,If it weren't for sheer dumb luck,\NI might've gotten shot down too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.35,0:17:08.64,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Hey, do you want to be friends?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.64,0:17:09.78,DefaultItalics,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Oh... Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:13.09,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I can't help but sympathize with the girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.66,0:17:18.22,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,We'll have a girls' outing\Nover summer break, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:20.42,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,We could study at someone's\Nhouse or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:21.57,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.57,0:17:23.70,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,If we do a sleepover, we could watch movies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:27.68,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,That sounds like so much fun! \NA pajama party!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:28.98,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,When do you want to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:31.62,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Mika-chan, do your parents allow sleepovers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:32.49,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:35.39,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess I'm included in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:36.86,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.45,0:17:40.54,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, are your parents strict, Makoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:42.49,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Nah, it's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:48.50,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,I-I just thought I was the type that'd\Nnever be in pajama parties and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:53.53,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Let's do all the things high school girls do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.53,0:17:55.24,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,How about we don't?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:56.55,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:18:00.20,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,It does feel a little strange, \Nthough, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:02.84,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,You wouldn't think we would\Nall be in the same friend group.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.05,0:18:05.18,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:08.42,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,If we weren't all in the same class,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:09.90,DefaultTop,KENTO,0,0,0,,Hey, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:11.32,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'd never have made friends \Nwith any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:12.08,DefaultTop,KENTO,0,0,0,,I wanna hang out at Shima's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.08,0:18:13.19,DefaultTop,KENTO,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that a no?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:19.85,Default,HIROTO,0,0,0,,Please pass these along to each class.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:22.78,Default,HIROTO,0,0,0,,That concludes the class officers meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:24.70,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:29.64,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,We could just mention it\Nin morning homeroom, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:31.23,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:33.87,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Speaking of mornings, today...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.27,0:18:37.12,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Remember how I said the zoo \Nwould be super crowded?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:38.30,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:41.34,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I still get nervous around him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.34,0:18:42.79,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,And what about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.79,0:18:44.35,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,W-Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:45.79,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I looked into it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:49.13,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,and apparently it's not too bad on weekdays, \Neven during summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.13,0:18:50.35,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.35,0:18:52.23,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Whoops, forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:53.42,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:56.61,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Of course! Adults don't get summer breaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.59,0:18:56.61,DefaultItalicsTop,MIKA,0,0,0,,Yikes, how am I supposed to go in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:19:00.61,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Sorry for jumping to conclusions\Nand scaring you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.17,0:19:02.94,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,He's so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.94,0:19:06.74,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Dumb luck or not, I'm so glad we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:12.72,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I do fantasize about how it'd be fun for us \Nto go to the zoo together and stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:15.08,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,but I want to treasure this friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:17.15,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Are you gonna go with anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:19.13,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.13,0:19:19.97,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Do you want to go in a group?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:21.38,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Do you want to go together?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:28.64,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Urk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:32.90,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Arrrggghhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:34.14,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It slipped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.14,0:19:35.22,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.99,0:19:38.64,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Before Obon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.64,0:19:40.40,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,When are you free?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:42.03,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.03,0:19:43.28,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Huh? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.78,0:19:46.53,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,It's easier to get around in a smaller \Ngroup of two to three people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.06,0:19:49.11,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,How about Thursday or Friday \Nthe week after next?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.11,0:19:51.05,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,He's so casual about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:55.16,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,He's usually so tuned in \Nto what girls are thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:57.70,DefaultTop,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,A day with clear weather would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:59.73,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,but he can't read my \N"Wait, isn't this a date?" aura?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:19:59.73,DefaultTop,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Thursday or Friday...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.73,0:20:01.30,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, Thursday, then...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.30,0:20:04.56,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It could be that when he looks at me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.56,0:20:05.62,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You wanna hang out together?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.62,0:20:06.98,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.98,0:20:09.81,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,...that's what he sees!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:12.53,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I've never seen a panda in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.53,0:20:13.69,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:14.63,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:17.08,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I thought all Tokyo folk would've seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.08,0:20:18.00,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Even then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.62,0:20:20.36,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.36,0:20:24.32,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm happy he doesn't mind\Ngoing places with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:26.07,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.96,0:20:30.88,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.62,0:20:36.58,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm getting a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:37.87,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.90,0:20:40.21,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,What? You're at the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.21,0:20:43.47,Default,RIRIKA,0,0,0,,Yeah. I wanted to see \Nwhat your school's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.81,0:20:46.29,Default,RIRIKA,0,0,0,,Come on, what's the big problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.73,0:20:49.43,Default,RIRIKA,0,0,0,,Whatever. I'll just ask this girl here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.92,0:20:51.82,Default,RIRIKA,0,0,0,,Hey, you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:59.90,Default,RIRIKA,0,0,0,,Do you know which class Shima Sousuke's in?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.71,0:21:04.27,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Sorry! Something came up. I gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.27,0:21:05.92,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:12.58,Default,RIRIKA,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:14.75,Default,RIRIKA,0,0,0,,This it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.75,0:21:16.33,Default,RIRIKA,0,0,0,,It's so average.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.89,0:21:29.60,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,M-Might you be Mika-chan's friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.47,0:21:33.73,Default,RIRIKA,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:36.34,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.34,0:21:37.33,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Ririka!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.33,0:21:39.48,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I told you to wait at the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:41.50,Default,RIRIKA,0,0,0,,I never agreed to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:43.74,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You're not allowed inside! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.16,0:21:45.44,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Bye, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.44,0:21:46.24,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.09,0:21:51.03,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,She sure was unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.03,0:21:52.62,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Uh, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.62,0:21:54.54,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,That doesn't even begin to describe her!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.96,0:22:08.28,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That the girl we just saw, don'cha reckon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.28,0:22:09.57,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, I reckon!

